1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Soldiers are we,

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
whose lives are pledged to Ireland.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,900
Some have come,

4
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:17,000
from a land beyond the wave.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Sworn to be free,

6
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:28,500
no more our ancient sireland,

7
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:35,500
shall shelter the despot or the slave.

8
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:40,000
Tonight we man the "bearna baoil",

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
in Erin's cause, come woe or weal.

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:51,200
'Mid cannon's roar and rifles' peal:

11
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:56,000
We'll chant a soldier's song!